{
  "title": "Travel and transport",
  "note": "The way you travel comes before the verb of motion: 坐 + vehicle + 去 + place, 我坐火车去上海. Use 坐 for vehicles you ride in, 骑 for things you straddle (bikes, horses), and 开 for driving. 要 + a length of time means \"it takes\": 要五个小时.",
  "src": { "t": "Chinese Grammar Wiki: using the verb 去", "u": "https://resources.allsetlearning.com/chinese/grammar/ASGFYNCL" },
